  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CHD, Regional Dialog</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CHD, Regional Dialogue</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Regional dialogue results in enhanced understanding by the region on collective steps that would contribute towards stability and development in Rakhine State.  2. Consultations with Bangladesh and Myanmar at multiple levels result in stronger mutual understanding and enhanced cooperation on the Rohingya issue especially on border and security issues.  3. Myanmar is exposed to relevant international experiences and humanitarian practices that contribute to more constructive policies and long-term stability in Rakhine State.  4. Official international processes including the Bali Process and the Annan Commission are effective in their contributions to addressing the Rohingya issue and are informed by the views of affected regional States.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention is a Project support to Centre for Humanitarian Dialogue (HD). The Project aims at securing long term stability and promoting solutions through sustained dialogue at the regional level.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utvecklingsinsatsen &#xe4;r ett projektst&#xf6;d till Centre for Humanitarian Dialogue (HD) f&#xf6;r ett regionalt dialoginitiativ som syftar till att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra situationen f&#xf6;r olika grupper i regionen.</narrative>
  </description>
